---
// NJ Design-Build footer — ported from the mockup's 4-col footer, not the
// shared src/components/Footer.astro (which hardcodes MA-specific
// LocalBusiness JSON-LD and a Boston-condo newsletter headline that don't
// apply here). Same visual language (forest/bone/gold), same governance
// constraint as NYFooter: the licensing line below is EXACT per the build
// spec (Section 8) — do not shorten or paraphrase it.
---

