      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>What We Build</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/nj/backyard-design-build/#services">Season Rooms &amp; Patio Conversions</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nj/backyard-design-build/#services">Elevated Decks</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nj/backyard-design-build/#services">Patio Enclosures</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nj/backyard-design-build/#services">Hardscape &amp; Patios</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nj/project-request/">Get a free site visit</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Company</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/nj/backyard-design-build/#process">Our Process</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nj/backyard-design-build/#sample">Sample Estimates</a></li>
